A quote at the start of a span opens

```
x.="q"=
.
<p>x.<mark>“q”</mark></p>
```

```
x.*"q"* and x./'q'/
.
<p>x.<strong>“q”</strong> and x.<em>‘q’</em></p>
```

```
x.*/"q"/* and x.{^"q"^}
.
<p>x.<strong><em>“q”</em></strong> and x.<sup>“q”</sup></p>
```

```
*a*"q" and x="q"
.
<p><strong>a</strong>”q” and x=“q”</p>
```
